# 64 GB tier, night 64-6, phase C: delegate-mode cells for the 8-bit worker (plan-64-6.md §4).
# Wired: 48 GB. Cloud: one ledger, hard cap $12 (FRONTIER_COST_CAP=12).
# Run (by the launcher, only when tier64-6-hybrid.env names a binary and a local_dispatch level
# from dispatch re-probe 7): BENCH_NAV_PILOT=<binary> BENCH_NP_CONFIG_LINE='local_dispatch = "<level>"'
#   night-run-3 --part hybrid --queue <this>
#
# Shape of optiq's delegate entry (edit-multi-mechanical 35/35 over 2 tasks, cost ratio < 1 on a
# codebase): per class two tasks, two controls and four hybrid samples per cell. The floor is
# >= 5 dispatched runs over >= 2 tasks, so each class needs >= 5 of its 8 hybrid samples dispatched.
# edit-single has one hybrid task (E1), so it can reach not-yet at best; it is here for its
# dispatch rate and pass rate. Ordered by what the cap should buy first.
# Cost from probe 6 (Sonnet 5): cf5 ~$0.30-0.40 a sample, r4 ~$0.13-0.19, E1 ~$0.06; ~$7 expected.
#
# part  kind   target                      arm     samples rung timeout expected profile
hybrid hybrid isoppfolgingstilfelle-large control 2       4    30      5        qwen3.6-35b-a3b-8bit-64g
hybrid hybrid isoppfolgingstilfelle-large hybrid  4       4    60      10       qwen3.6-35b-a3b-8bit-64g
hybrid hybrid isoppfolgingstilfelle-large control 2       5    30      5        qwen3.6-35b-a3b-8bit-64g
hybrid hybrid isoppfolgingstilfelle-large hybrid  4       5    60      12       qwen3.6-35b-a3b-8bit-64g
hybrid hybrid isoppfolgingstilfelle-tests control 2       1    30      5        qwen3.6-35b-a3b-8bit-64g
hybrid hybrid isoppfolgingstilfelle-tests hybrid  4       1    100     25       qwen3.6-35b-a3b-8bit-64g
hybrid hybrid isoppfolgingstilfelle-tests control 2       2    30      5        qwen3.6-35b-a3b-8bit-64g
hybrid hybrid isoppfolgingstilfelle-tests hybrid  4       2    100     25       qwen3.6-35b-a3b-8bit-64g
hybrid hybrid tasks                       control 2       2    20      3        qwen3.6-35b-a3b-8bit-64g
hybrid hybrid tasks                       hybrid  4       2    40      6        qwen3.6-35b-a3b-8bit-64g
hybrid hybrid frontend-familie-tilbake    control 2       2    20      3        qwen3.6-35b-a3b-8bit-64g
